{"metadata":{"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"slug":[{"Plain":"自旋流形"},0],"title":[{"Plain":"自旋流形"},2],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p>自旋流形是带有 "},{"Local":{"url":"切结构","text":"$\\mathrm{Spin}_n$-结构"}},{"Plain":"的流形.</p>\n<h2>粒子物理</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"自旋统计定理","text":"自旋统计定理"}},{"Plain":"指出, 不带电"},{"Local":{"url":"费米子","text":"费米子"}},{"Plain":"的波函数是一个"},{"Local":{"url":"旋量","text":"旋量"}},{"Plain":"丛的截面.</p>\n"}]}}